# Wave W17-AB (Foamline Path): foam pine — a shore-end pine in bright sunlit greens, tiered and open, its highlight lifted high, standing in bright shore grass baked into the tile (the causeway ships no ground register — the frame trees stand in their own shore grass, as every fleet tree tile carries its footing). Foamline’s own tree — split from Route 218’s cause pine by weather entire (sunlit bright vs rain-dark deep) and from Route 224’s head pine by stance: this pine frames a plank road over water, that one stands on a walked dry coast.
